                                "sense_id": "b08fc4f2-77e0-3e52-a074-39b041417060",
                                "text": "The Holy Bible, […] (King James Version), London: […] Robert Barker, […], 1611, →OCLC, Matthew 14:17: “And they say unto him, We have here but five loaves, and two fishes.”"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "303e4e22-59c2-44f7-b806-e034c1a228bc",
                                "sense_id": "b08fc4f2-77e0-3e52-a074-39b041417060",
                                "text": "\"The evil is for those benighted ones who will have none of it; seeing the light the true believers worship, as the fishes see the stars, but dimly.\""
